# Cloudflare Pages Headers Configuration

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self' https: data: 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https:; font-src 'self' https: data:; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https:; worker-src 'self' blob:;
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
